"<li><b>Grayscale</b></li></ul>  <b>Note:</b> This selection field may be "
"grayed out and made inactive.  This happens if KDEPrint can not retrieve  "
"enough information about your print file. In this case the embedded color- "
"or grayscale information  of your printfile, and the default handling of the "
